  m_text: "Welcome to the bar! Customers are lining up, ready to order their favorite
    drinks. It\u2019s your job to mix them just right\u2014follow their requests,
    pour with precision, and serve up the perfect cocktail. Stay sharp, because the
    better you mix, the bigger the tips!\n\nAre you ready to get shaking? Just press
